+// Browser build only: runs the OneLife server inside the client's page.
+//
+// The server's main loop was split into serverSetup() / serverStep() /
+// serverCleanup() (see server/server.cpp).  We call serverSetup() the first
+// time the client tries to connect, then one serverStep() per browser frame.
+// Client and server talk through the in-memory sockets in
+// minorGems/network/emscripten.
+
