+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Single-player NPC family
+//
+// NPCs are normal LiveObjects connected through an NpcLink (socket pair).
+// Each think step they queue the same text commands a real client would
+// send (MOVE, USE, SELF, UBABY, SAY), so all game rules apply to them.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
